## Add a new module / service (N steps)
1. `scripts/scaffold-<name>.mjs` (if L3) — generates skeleton.
2. Define contract first (`contracts/openapi/<name>.yaml`).
3. Write typed routes mirroring it.
4. Schema + migration.
5. Add a row to `docs/FEATURES.md` + `docs/REVIEW.md`.
6. Add a card to `docs/REFERENCE.md` + an ADR if a significant decision was made.
7. Tests: health/contract/integration. Run the full suite.

