## Testing
```bash
pnpm test            # unit (vitest) — no storage
pnpm run test:contract   # OpenAPI conformance
pnpm test:e2e        # end-to-end (Playwright) — needs stack up
```
> Exact commands per your package manager/tooling — **verify they work** before
> committing this file. Nothing trips a new dev like dead instructions.